  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook the glass noodles according to the packet instructions, drain and set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the olive oil in a wide frying pan, add the thinly sliced onion and ginger and stir-fry until golden. Add the carrot cut into strips and stir-fry for about 1 minute, then add the mushrooms and stir-fry for 1 more minute. Add the noodles and mix well."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the soy sauce, date syrup, chilli, salt and sesame oil and mix until combined with the vegetables."
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with chopped coriander and serve."
